  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Enchantment Spell. For 5...10...11 seconds you are no longer Crippled, and you move 33% faster. When Illusion of Haste ends, you become Crippled for 3 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "持續 5～11 秒，你的「殘廢」病症消失而且移動速度增加 33% 。但是當迅速幻覺的效果終止時，你將遭受「殘廢」病症 3 秒。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Enchantment Spell. For 5...10...11 seconds, you move 33% faster. When Illusion of Haste ends, you become Crippled for 3 seconds.",
